; 4_fm_example_e — Final Fight style brawler verse (E minor)
;
; Syncopated motif with brief silence — driving but with breathing
; room.  Classic CPS-1/M68k arcade FM brawler feel.

T220
I4
V13
O4
L8

; A — main motif (3-note climb + descent)
E G B  > D < B G  E G B4
F+ A > C  > E < C < A  F+ A > C4

; B — call/response
G G E E  D D < B B
> C C < A A  G G E E

; C — long arc
E F+ G A  B > C < B A
G F+ E D  C < B A G
F+ G A B  > C D E F+
> G4 R4 R2

